      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-17T22:37:49.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS in line with analyst expectations despite revenue beat",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹29.59 (up from ₹29.51 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹15.4b (up 22% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.94b (flat on FY 2025). Profit margin: 13% (down from 15% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 1.5%. Earnings per share (EPS) were mostly in line with analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 14% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 20% growth forecast for the Healthcare industry in India.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
    {
