      "date": "2026-05-09T08:06:21.000Z",
      "title": "JLHL: BKC Hospital Lease Will Support Future Expansion And Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have raised their price target on Jupiter Life Line Hospitals slightly from ₹1,599 to ₹1,609, citing updated assumptions around discount rates, revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E that together suggest a modestly higher assessed fair value. What's in the News Jupiter Life Line Hospitals received acceptance from the Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority for the allotment of land on a long term lease for hospital development at Bandra Kurla Complex, Maharashtra (Key Developments).",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
